        '# Backend Development with FastAPI\n\n## Beginner: FastAPI Setup & Routes\nASGI server Uvicorn runs FastAPI (`uvicorn app.main:app --reload`). Auto-generated Swagger docs available at `/docs`. Use `.env` for secrets.\n\n## Intermediate: Pydantic Validation & Route Parameters\nPath parameters `/items/{id}` identify resources; query parameters `/items?done=true` filter. Pydantic `BaseModel` validates input, converts types, and throws HTTP 422 on invalid data. Use `Field(gt=0)` and `@field_validator`.\n\n## Advanced & Experienced Engineer: Yield Dependencies & Middleware\n`yield` dependencies open DB sessions before requests and guarantee cleanup (`finally: db.close()`) even on error. Middleware intercepts requests (`await call_next(request)`). Use `BackgroundTasks` for deferred background execution.',
